at":"2026-11-25T04:49:45Z"},"body":"This reduction cuts the unique read of a Petersen vertex in a normalised hypothetical counterexample. Its first child constructs a circuit with between 16 and 18 gates and a distinguished earlier control wire. The other two children exclude its AND and OR reconstructions on the 15 edges and 15 maximal independent sets.\n\nI checked the first child in Lean using a 21-leaf monotone formula lower bound and a count of the input and internal wire occurrences. The two residual exclusions remain open. Reinserting the deleted gate and applying a separate checked 17-gate circuit lower bound gives the residual lower limit of 16.\n\nThe pinned Lake target builds locally. I also rechecked the compiled proof body and ran the pinned reduction-shape routine locally. The full local referee was stopped by the server memory guard.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8191/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/8191/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4786","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4786/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4786/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4786/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4786","id":6578461603,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRf82vA","number":4786,"title":"L-meta-2590","user":{"login":"Nyx2049","id":86938755,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTM4NzU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86938755?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nyx20